course: dictionary
lesson: 4256
title: Grassy: covered with grass, or like grass
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Grassy is an adjective, so it describes a noun. It means covered with grass. «Alice is sitting on a grassy bank next to her big sister» tells you the bank is covered in grass, not stone or mud.
explain: Grassy has a second meaning: like grass, especially in smell or taste. A grassy smell is the fresh, green smell of cut grass, and a grassy taste is the taste of something green and plant-like.
explain: To check a meaning, swap it into the sentence. «The African savanna area is one big grassy paddock» means one big paddock covered with grass, and that makes sense. You can also use the words around it as clues: a savannah is a wide, open land, so grassy fits.
fact: Grassy means covered with grass.
fact: Grassy can also mean like grass in smell or taste.
fact: Grassy is an adjective, so it describes a noun, as in «a grassy hill».
fact: The other forms are grassier and grassiest: «The hill is grassier than the road.»
fact: A grassy plain, such as a savannah or a prairie, is a huge, flat place covered with grass.
exercise: «Alice is sitting on a grassy bank next to her big sister.» What does grassy mean here? | Steep and rocky | Wet from the rain | *Covered with grass | Very cold
exercise: «Mammoths lived on a grassy steppe.» What kind of land was the steppe? | *A huge flat plain covered with grass | A deep, dark cave | A cold sea | A busy town with many roads
exercise: Mum says the tea tastes grassy. What does grassy mean here? | *Like grass in taste | Very sweet and sugary | Hot and spicy | Covered with grass
test:
Which word is the comparative form of grassy, meaning more grassy? | grassy | grass | grassily | *grassier
Zara says the old hay smells grassy. What does she mean? | Covered in hay | Very dusty | Frozen solid | *Like grass in smell
exam:
«In real life lions live on grassy savannah.» What does grassy tell us about the savannah? | It is under water | It is made of stone | *It is covered with grass | It is a busy city street
